[{"client_msg_id":"9d823743-df90-461a-b86a-994e37360317","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"あ、ここ\u003c#C01LXT3BWBU|neovim-plugins\u003eでしたね\n\u003c#CRNLJDTU1|vim-jp\u003eの方に投げてみます:bow:","ts":"1616632043.079700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EXp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6a3c9e2-83eb-49b7-9d16-1b7230908ebe","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"いずれにせよ、\u003c#CRNLJDTU1|vim-jp\u003e で会話したほうが良いかもしれないですね","ts":"1616631719.078900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CJee"}]},{"client_msg_id":"025bfc7c-27a2-4adc-8a35-046f5abd5046","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"ですよね。\n私もそのあたりをきちんとはっきりさせないといけないと思います。\n今上げている分はまだ少ないしいいかなとやってしまってますが、あまり良くないですよね…\nとりあえずリポジトリの公開範囲をprivateにしておいたほうがいいですかね？","ts":"1616631291.078500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pmx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"418bdc33-d8ad-4ec9-9ac8-1781a257e7e2","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"うーん。個人的な意見ですが、原文ママの引用で終わらせるならともかく、何かしらの改変を行って記事にするなら明示的に合意をとったほうが良いと思います。","ts":"1616630507.072700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mowCt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35986706-bb64-46bb-9d9b-c6281d057746","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"数が増えて真面目に考えるに値する量になってきたらまた考えますかね…","ts":"1616628463.064900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a/3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"701d3bb1-98df-4f54-b3b8-1aaa7499346c","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"ツラミの種類をすり替えてるだけなので、本質的解決ではないですが。","ts":"1616628259.063900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+K/7x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e754bebd-6737-45ee-9394-2fdf2af9717a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"たしかに","ts":"1616628130.061700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YLxL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7af04c82-1dce-46a6-af64-3a103840f394","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"どちらかというと、ここに書いたことの引用要件を決めてしまって、「だれでも気軽にここの発言を引用できる状態」を目指したほうが手っ取り早そうでは…ある…","ts":"1616628105.061400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S4n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a860add-b585-4eed-b89c-6ba3c181e8ee","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"GitHubはともかく、zennのアカウントを管理する必要性が生じてしまうなぁ","ts":"1616628036.060700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4qf="}]},{"client_msg_id":"317cb3ad-b31d-496e-8b2f-234085b95e0e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"リポジトリをpublicにしといて記事はそこにPRで投げる","ts":"1616628036.060600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"benri","count":3,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ","UL6CFN8NR","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"05aw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"828a6d57-e101-4694-9bab-1d0ae80dccbf","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"- zennに適当なアカウントを作る\n- GitHubに適当なリポジトリを用意する\n   - ここのcontributeさっせる\nでイケそうではあるが","ts":"1616628009.059900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"686N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db7b5c05-5858-453c-b1f6-a43e1c3f0428","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"orgと連携できるのかは知らないが","ts":"1616627998.059600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nJi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cabe08cd-615a-48a0-b2a5-3078d691187b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"誰が管理するのか問題はあるけどGitHub連携あるのでいけそうな気はする","ts":"1616627987.059200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"42h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7fa76f03-9984-4cb9-9695-da654e0520ff","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"とりあえず下書きという形でリポジトリ作りましたが、続けていくなら別の媒体に載せたいですね\n（Zennとかだと数が増えた（あるのか？）ときに他人の記事が目立たなくなってしまうかなと思ったりもしたんですよね）","ts":"1616627851.058400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cBh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"355639fc-d659-4245-8253-263a6385120a","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"折角なら記事の形で見られると良いと思いますね。vim-jp コミュニティとして Zenn に記事を出したりとかってできるんだろうか","ts":"1616627390.054400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xrUq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbe3e2ac-7c24-44be-a318-bee7be93f75f","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/kato-k/vim-tips\u003e\nこんな感じ?","ts":"1616608229.052800","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: kato-k/vim-tips","id":1,"title":"kato-k/vim-tips","title_link":"https://github.com/kato-k/vim-tips","text":"Contribute to kato-k/vim-tips development by creating an account on GitHub.","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45391880?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https://github.com/kato-k/vim-tips","original_url":"https://github.com/kato-k/vim-tips"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1=dp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0990a95e-63e8-424e-9cd8-f7f05d63e96e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"短い記事を書いてみるのはいいと思います","ts":"1616599895.051800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"16X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4fe2f90c-939d-479a-91b8-b9a3f4645da4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"TwitterやSlackで呟いたりScrapboxに散文を吐き出したりするのが限界","ts":"1616599854.051400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TX57k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d46636b-e2e2-47bf-9955-62fcad2fb375","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Zenn で「短い記事を大量に書く」的なチャレンジやってみようかな？「x min 以内に読み終わる記事を、○日に一回のペースで公開する」的な。\n私もともと記事を書ききるのが苦手で、アドベントカレンダーみたいなイベントがない限り記事を完成させて外部に公開するというのができないんですよね","ts":"1616599813.050800","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1616599864.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U7B4ZD49X","U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yC1wg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8cdeb1e0-45a7-42b0-a933-0f7ad9dea27b","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"とてもわかりやすい記事の構成されてるなと思いました","ts":"1616599811.050700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MFD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5b2dfbf-0a2e-4a58-b8b6-f0ae2221b503","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"さっきの記事もっかい読んでて、なーんとなくここの人達って「書くこと」より「テキストエディタ」の方が好きなんだなって思った","ts":"1616599669.048800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HdE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d84b9217-061b-4a44-ab32-dadfb37f0aa5","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"試しにいくつか書いてみようかしら","ts":"1616599650.048300","edited":{"user":"U017BU3UZBQ","ts":"1616599660.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PFv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3eb5f3b4-0994-44cb-b771-64234c5a4c9b","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"ちょうどこんな感じの\n\u003chttps://vim-jp.org/vim-users-jp/2009/10/28/Hack-94.html\u003e","ts":"1616599304.047700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GyV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"228b5472-9a3d-4c98-b368-b5bb6e6f40d6","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"3つずつくらいパックにして小出ししていけば一番手軽に効率よくいいね集められそう","ts":"1616599300.047500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8SBs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4ef9aef-c22f-46f2-b85f-28ac4e84c912","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"~無駄にいかがでしたか？入れておこう~","ts":"1616599241.046400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"scream","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"flIyf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b11dd71-87a0-4f11-b34a-a9653fc80581","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"Vim-jpまとめサイト","ts":"1616599219.045700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iz8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65618061-30bc-4240-80e3-eab6c9c6d29c","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"それ今日私も同じこと考えてましたね","ts":"1616599200.045400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YLL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7ecf685-fdcf-4e46-9df0-04c49174080b","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"とりあえずpicked-tipsの内容をまとめたら色々と便利そうと思ったのですが、自分の考えたものでもないし勝手にまとめて公開するのもな〜と思ってます","ts":"1616599176.045000","edited":{"user":"U017BU3UZBQ","ts":"1616599203.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xzyx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62eb2326-1b1a-4b65-a795-4952fe1ba6c3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"対外記事としてemacs-jpの入門記事みたいなのがあるといいよなぁって思ってる（自分で書けという話）","ts":"1616598730.043400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SCKvw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62643bfc-0316-44cf-8cc7-6a9d34d0885b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":sorena:","ts":"1616598684.043000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pG/x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c3f40bc-ff16-4bfb-877d-fc38a07e19cf","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"ここの存在を知らない人とか、よくわからんけどとりあえず初めてみようと思ってる人にはやっぱり記事が一番まとまってていいんですけどね。\n自分の書いた記事を読んで欲しい対象の多くが一箇所にいるとすると、そこで適当にしゃべった方が生産性いいんですよね・・・記事にする労力を払ってまで届けたい人が外側にあまりいないというのが、いいのかわるいのか。","ts":"1616598636.042500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sm4=A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9954df71-1c08-4ea3-8f7b-c7f385fb051c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"確かに何も書く気起きないw","ts":"1616598186.038000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A9E+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2ee6281-b7df-4629-9a8d-b83577353faa","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"そしてここにいる人ここで発散されてしまって以前よりも記事の出が悪い気がしてる","ts":"1616598161.037300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3NY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"099099e9-8b25-4d6a-b211-4cda9bee8599","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"vim-jp見ているとモダンな物を使って当然みたいな空気を感じることがあるけど他の場所だとそうじゃないのかもと思った","ts":"1616598123.036600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rz0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11dc8640-38a8-4d35-95d0-561a796560b7","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"別にもう使わない方がいいのでは系のプラグインは入ってないんですけどね・・・せめてもうちょっといいモダンにできる気がする。","ts":"1616598040.036000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HlO"}]}]
